# Text files get LF normalisation on commit. Git decides what counts as text by
# sniffing content, which is reliable but implicit - and this repository ships a
# 15 MB model artefact whose corruption would be silent until the ML service
# failed to start. The rules below take that decision away from the heuristic.
* text=auto

# The served model. Never normalise, never diff as text.
*.onnx binary
*.pt    binary
*.pth   binary

# Screenshots and other image evidence.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary

# Fonts, archives and compiled artefacts that may appear under tooling.
*.zip  binary
*.jar  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
